{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Six rectangles each with a common base width of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> have lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/9/e69fe4d05d1e94efc4d6aa47df7c20c435ee0ad5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 4, 9, 16, 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sum of the areas of the six rectangles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/56853cef245b25ab1521ae7922b51aa065a5e76c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }91\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }93\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }162\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }182\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }202$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the areas is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5ddddeb46c0b1319692027a1fc6e40028c769646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot1+2\\cdot4+2\\cdot9+2\\cdot16+2\\cdot25+2\\cdot36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"325\" height=\"14\" />. This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595d7440ceac212eef7ff449beaf338c5958e15b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(1+4+9+16+25+36)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />, which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/6226c1a2f1378dcd93caab4213f7161e16d2835f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot91$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />. This is equal to our final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f43ed9d9a7aceeff54e1b93f62d774008f2c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~182}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>we can just multiply the common width 2 by each of the lengths 1 by 1, the sum would be 182. This is slow and grouping the lengths is easier to. The answer is still <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f43ed9d9a7aceeff54e1b93f62d774008f2c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~182}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula for a consecutive perfect squared sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/4/184d1c193ab9f290f4678a6090bcdba95b03f715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"40\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of terms from 1.\n</p><p>Multiplying by the constant length 2 for area gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42af03afd5a2477bc2f2b9fe2c4255e7fa29ba8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e326b48726d4c73525c3b980409600fd87ea9846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 6$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f43ed9d9a7aceeff54e1b93f62d774008f2c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~182}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~PeterDoesPhysics\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-oIKrq97ya0\">https://youtu.be/-oIKrq97ya0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SvjJETtxQnk\">https://youtu.be/SvjJETtxQnk</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_